 5年以上B2B销售/BD/商机拓展经验，其中至少2年深耕人力资源行业（HR SaaS、人力资源服务、HR咨询、招聘服务任一方向）\n● 熟悉人力资源行业：理解HR数字化的典型业务场景（招聘、测评、绩效、薪酬、学习等），能与HRD/HRBP用业务语言对话，不只会讲产品功能\n● 具备人力条线与IT条线的双线人脉：手上有可触达的HR负责人和IT/数字化负责人资源，理解企业级软件采购中业务方与技术方的决策逻辑\n● 广开商机的自驱力：不依赖公司分配线索，能自己找路子、建渠道、破圈子，有可验证的从0到1开拓案例\n能力素质\n● 优秀的沟通表达与关系建立能力，擅长在行业圈子里经营个人影响力\n● 结果导向，抗压力强，能在长周期B2B销售节奏中保持耐心与韧性\n● 基础的数据意识：会看商机漏斗、会算转化率、会用CRM管理商机全过程\n加分项\n● 有北森、SAP SuccessFactors、Workday、大易、Moka等HR数字化产品的人脉圈或从业背景\n● 有AI产品商业化经验，对AI HR方向（数字员工、AI面试官、AI绩效专家等）有认知和热情\n● 在华东/上海市场有成熟的中大型企业客户资源，或拥有猎头、HR咨询行业的合作伙伴网络\n● 英语可作为工作语言（服务外资客户）","ClassificationOne":"销售类","ClassificationTwo":"上海分公司","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-01T14:35:38","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"846ad193-98f0-497c-991e-d8d5f6516e56","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":430045076,"PostDateInt":17